# Text files: one line ending everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.heic binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.webm binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.glb binary
*.pdf binary

# Large files through Git LFS. These lines are commented out until the owner decides
# (see "Where the big files live" in README.md). To turn them on: install git-lfs,
# run `git lfs install` once, uncomment, and `git add --renormalize .`.
# *.mp4 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.mov filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
